OL,3,GNEWSANew lease of life for depleted
OL,4,Afarmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeadows, ponds and wetlands look set to
OL,7,Freplace swathes of depleted farmland
OL,8,Fthrough a nature restoration project.
OL,10,FAlmost 70 acres (28ha) of low-yield
OL,11,Farable farmland near Warboys,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, are to be transformed,
OL,13,Fcreating new habitats for animals.
OL,15,FBiodiversity net gain provider Naturum,
OL,16,Fwhich is leading on the project, said
OL,17,Fthe land had been "farmed intensively
OL,18,Ffor decades" and cannot produce food
OL,19,Flike it once did.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
